---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Jasmer's Corner" description="Academic background, research interests, and technical philosophy.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-indigo-600 to-purple-600 dark:from-blue-400 dark:via-indigo-400 dark:to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">About</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Hey there! 👋 I'm an <strong>undergrad</strong> at the <strong>Indian Institute of Technology Indore</strong>, 
          passionate about <strong>deep learning</strong>, <strong>mathematics</strong>, and <strong>competitive programming</strong>. 
          I enjoy building systems that learn, adapt, and solve challenging problems.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mt-4">
          This page provides an overview of my academic background, research interests, and competitive 
          programming journey. It serves as a comprehensive introduction to my work and approach to 
          engineering and research.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Academic Background</h2>
          <div class="space-y-2 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              <strong>Indian Institute of Technology Indore</strong><br/>
              B.Tech in Electrical Engineering<br/>
              <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">2022 – 2026 • CGPA: 9.05/10</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Research Interests</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
            <li><strong>Deep Learning:</strong> Audio-visual speech enhancement, medical image segmentation, neural architecture design</li>
            <li><strong>6G Communications:</strong> CSI-RS processing, machine learning-based signal processing for physical layer standards</li>
            <li><strong>Reinforcement Learning:</strong> DQN-based game playing agents, policy optimization</li>
            <li><strong>Signal Processing:</strong> Speech enhancement, temporal feature extraction, audio-visual fusion</li>
            <li><strong>Medical Imaging:</strong> Liver tumor segmentation, polyp segmentation, multi-scale attention networks</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Technical Skills</h2>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
            <div>
              <strong>Languages:</strong> C++, Python, MATLAB
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Frameworks & Tools:</strong> Git, PyTorch, TensorFlow, OpenCV, NumPy, backtesting.py, UnTrade SDK, Pennylane
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Operating Systems:</strong> Windows, Linux
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Other Skills:</strong> Competitive Programming, Data Structures and Algorithms, Object Oriented Programming
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Competitive Programming</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            I'm an Expert on Codeforces (handle: <code class="text-sm bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">von_Braun</code>), 
            demonstrating strong coding and reasoning ability. I actively solve problems on LeetCode, USACO, and CSES Problem Set, 
            focusing on algorithmic thinking and efficient problem-solving techniques.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-4">
            <a
              href="https://leetcode.com/jasmers"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-4 py-2 border-2 border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg hover:border-slate-900 dark:hover:border-slate-100 transition-colors"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M16.102 17.93l-2.697 2.607c-.466.467-1.111.662-1.823.662s-1.357-.195-1.824-.662L2.102 13.607c-.467-.467-.702-1.15-.702-1.863s.235-1.357.702-1.824l4.389-4.39c.467-.467 1.15-.702 1.824-.702s1.357.235 1.823.702l.331.331c.195.195.512.195.707 0l2.414-2.414c.195-.195.512-.195.707 0l.331.331c.467.467 1.15.702 1.824.702s1.357-.235 1.823-.702l4.389-4.39c.467-.467 1.15-.702 1.824-.702s1.357.235 1.824.702l2.697 2.607c.467.467.702 1.15.702 1.824s-.235 1.357-.702 1.823l-4.389 4.39c-.467.467-1.15.702-1.824.702s-1.357-.235-1.823-.702l-.331-.331c-.195-.195-.512-.195-.707 0l-2.414 2.414c-.195.195-.512.195-.707 0l-.331-.331c-.467-.467-1.15-.702-1.824-.702s-1.357.235-1.823.702l-4.389 4.39c-.467.467-.702 1.15-.702 1.824s.235 1.357.702 1.823z"/>
              </svg>
              <span>LeetCode</span>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://codeforces.com/profile/von_Braun"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-4 py-2 border-2 border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg hover:border-slate-900 dark:hover:border-slate-100 transition-colors"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M4.5 7.5C5.328 7.5 6 8.172 6 9v10.5c0 .828-.672 1.5-1.5 1.5h-3C.672 21 0 20.328 0 19.5V9c0-.828.672-1.5 1.5-1.5h3zm9-4.5C14.328 3 15 3.672 15 4.5v15c0 .828-.672 1.5-1.5 1.5h-3c-.828 0-1.5-.672-1.5-1.5v-15c0-.828.672-1.5 1.5-1.5h3zm9 7.5C23.328 10.5 24 11.172 24 12v7.5c0 .828-.672 1.5-1.5 1.5h-3c-.828 0-1.5-.672-1.5-1.5V12c0-.828.672-1.5 1.5-1.5h3z"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Codeforces</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Achievements</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
            <li>Received <strong>IEEE SPS ME-UYR Grant</strong>, in collaboration with University of Groningen, Netherlands (2025)</li>
            <li><strong>Expert on Codeforces</strong>, demonstrating strong coding and reasoning ability</li>
            <li>Selected for <strong>Amazon ML Summer School</strong>, Amazon MLSS (2024)</li>
            <li><strong>All India Rank 3002</strong> (out of 200k+ aspirants), JEE Advanced 2022</li>
            <li><strong>99.1%ile</strong> (out of 800k+ aspirants), JEE Mains 2022</li>
            <li><strong>IOQM Certificate of Merit</strong>, Indian Olympiad Qualifier in Mathematics (2022)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

